      "assumption": "Diverse, decentralized experimentation produces safer outcomes than top-down, standardized protocols.",
      "if_wrong": "If centralized standards are proven to be more effective than decentralized experimentation at preventing catastrophic failure, then the stagnation levy becomes a justified cost."
